  "worked_solution": "Since we need to divide by $5$, we split the whole into $5$ equal parts horizontally.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133144/assets/6f6f8eda89ca98c62fe583fc6218f497bdf1a7056b792ade26edd064ffba2c95.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents $\\frac{3}{20}$ of the whole.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}÷5=\\frac{3}{20}.\n$$",
